  m_text: "\tWell hi there! Welcome to the hopefully coherent ramblings of a sane
    man.\n\n\tIn this project, I hope to share some of my thoughts and ideas regarding
    UX within VR platforms, along with examples to demonstrate each one.\n\n\tIf
    you're familiar with navigating in VR, you can go ahead and look around, otherwise
    just press this button and I'll show you all you need to know!"
